=3D"Open the Google Workspace for Education Privacy Center page in a new ta=
b">Google Workspace for Education Privacy Center</a>&nbsp;for answers to mo=
st questions. Also see our&nbsp;<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener norefe=
rrer" href=3D"https://support.google.com/policies/troubleshooter/2990837" a=
ria-label=3D"Open the Privacy Help Center page in a new tab">Privacy Help C=
enter</a>&nbsp;for questions about privacy and Google=E2=80=99s services.</=
p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <p>If you=E2=80=99re a parent:</p>
                      <ul>
                        <li>
                          <p class=3D"strong-item"><strong>=E2=80=A2 </stro=
ng>Contact your school admin if you have questions regarding the management=
 of Google Workspace for Education accounts or the use of information by yo=
